  "unresolved": [
    "The independent lattice benzene has large anisotropic displacement parameters consistent with unresolved motion/disorder. A density-anchored rigid two-orientation PART/SADI trial worsened R1 and wR2; the one-site model was retained with six DFIX 1.390(10) A and FLAT 0.01 A restraints.",
    "Final SHELXL difference density is approximately +1.57/-1.58 e A^-3. The strongest positive peak is 1.25-1.28 A from N3 in the La/Ni complex, but no chemically valid additional atom or coherent minor component is supported; no chemistry-free atom was added. This is relevant to any PLAT975-style alert.",
    "The supplied TWINABS HKLF4 contains only independent merged reflections, so an experimental R_int cannot be reconstructed. Overall completeness is 0.741 to d_min 0.682 A; checkCIF theta-full completeness is about 0.907.",
    "Crystal temperature, dimensions, colour/habit, cell-measurement reflection count/range and absorption-correction details are incomplete in context.json and must be supplied for a fully complete journal CIF.",
    "A correctly reindexed TWINABS HKLF5 refinement gave BASF 0.00875 without meaningful improvement over HKLF4; the second component was therefore not retained."
  ],
  "summary_note": "Structure solved from the atom-free P-1 starting point by heavy-atom/Patterson analysis and SHELXT, then completed from difference density and refined anisotropically. The chemically complete formula is C38H60LaN8NiP2·C6H6. A correctly reindexed TWINABS HKLF5 trial (h5=-h4, k5=-k4, l5=h4+k4+l4) refined BASF to 0.00875 and did not improve the fit, so merged HKLF4 was retained. A rigid two-orientation lattice-benzene trial refined to 0.627/0.373 but worsened R1/wR2 and was rejected. The one-site benzene required six DFIX C-C=1.390(10) A restraints and FLAT 0.01 A because unresolved motion distorted its free geometry; no restraints affect the La/Ni complex. No solvent mask was used. Final SHELXL(check) retained all 66 riding C-H atoms and converged at R1(obs)=0.0666, R1(all)=0.0733, wR2=0.2100, GooF=1.028.",
